45
00:02:49,870 --> 00:02:52,750
Can you provide some insight into why she made that decision?

46
00:02:53,230 --> 00:02:53,610
That's right.

47
00:02:53,730 --> 00:03:00,610
So you want some more information or some type of explanation as to why she made that decision.

48
00:03:00,850 --> 00:03:01,230
Exactly.

49
00:03:01,450 --> 00:03:09,010
And so the teacher will then provide this insight by describing what he or she thinks about the student.

50
00:03:09,450 --> 00:03:10,010
That's right.

51
00:03:10,290 --> 00:03:17,000
And while the teacher went on to say that Alan is a great student, hard worker, very well behaved.

52
00:03:17,610 --> 00:03:22,000
So he is a hard worker. That means he is this is not an address.

53
