But you often hear this in regards to college or university.

87
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:27,930
So college tuitions in America are very expensive.

88
00:05:28,490 --> 00:05:28,770
That's right.

89
00:05:29,030 --> 00:05:33,050
And when a tuition is overdue, it means that it hasn't been paid yet.

90
00:05:33,190 --> 00:05:34,210
And so the payment is late.

91
00:05:34,510 --> 00:05:35,390
The payment is late.

92
00:05:35,390 --> 00:05:37,210
Now, a lot of things can be overdue.

93
00:05:37,390 --> 00:05:39,650
That means they've passed their due date.

94
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:40,850
A bill can be overdue.

95
00:05:41,230 --> 00:05:43,970
That's right. So you should have paid your bill already, but you haven't.

96
00:05:44,070 --> 00:05:44,690
So it's overdue.

